<title>USA: J &amp; J Snack sees Q1 shr down.</title>
<headline>J &amp; J Snack sees Q1 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>J &amp; J Snack Foods Corp said on Tuesday that it expects to earn net income of about $100,000, or $.01 a share, on sales of about $44,000,000 for its fiscal 1997 first quarter ended December 28, 1996.</p>
<p>For the comparable quarter a year ago, J &amp; J had net income of $827,000 or $.09 a share, on sales of $42,863,000.</p>
<p>The company cited significant sales declines from two major customers, a gain from a non-recurring equipment sale last year and a dilutive impact from a first quarter acquisition for the decline.</p>
